ps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123848#issuecomment-5871276076","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123848","id":5871276076,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXfSQLA","user":{"login":"YooRarely","id":16859387,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODU5Mzg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16859387?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YooRarely","html_url":"https://github.com/YooRarely","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YooRarely/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YooRarely/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YooRarely/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YooRarely/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YooRarely/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YooRarely/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YooRarely/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YooRarely/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YooRarely/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-28T13:51:59Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T13:51:59Z","body":"[mbp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32751858/mbp.zip)\nSorry for the verbose issue description. English is not my native language, and I have limited English reading skills, so I used AI to help polish the English in my original description.\n\nThe technical investigation, testing, and conclusions are my own.\n\nI have also created a minimal reproduction project as requested and attached the ZIP file here.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5871276076/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5871300505","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123848#issuecomment-5871300505","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123848","id":5871300505,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXfTvmQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-28T13:53:11Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T13:53:11Z","body":"This is not very polished it's verbose and hard to follow, so please use dedicated translation software instead to translate","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5871300505/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5871562675","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123848#issuecomment-5871562675","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123848","id":5871562675,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXfjvsw","user":{"login":"YooRarely","id":16859387,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODU5Mzg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16859387?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YooRarely","html_url":"https://github.com/YooRarely","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YooRarely/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YooRarely/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YooRarely/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YooRarely/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YooRarely/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YooRarely/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YooRarely/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YooRarely/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YooRarely/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-28T14:06:08Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T14:06:08Z","body":"I found that the result returned by `Callable.is_valid()` is unreliable. A Callable that can actually be called can return `false`.\n\nThis seems to happen specifically when `Callable.get_object()` returns a `GDScriptNativeClass` and the target method is static, such as the static methods in `FileAccess`.\n\n```gdscript\nvar callable: Callable = FileAccess.file_exists\n```\n\nThis is a Callable that can be called successfully, but `is_valid()` returns `false`.\n\nThen, if we bind an argument to it:\n\n```gdscript\ncallable.bind(\"res://icon.svg\")\n```\n\nthe resulting Callable changes from callable to uncallable. Calling `call()` on it produces an error.\n\nI found that the reason is that `Callable::is_valid()` uses the following code:\n\n```cpp\nreturn get_object() && get_object()->has_method(get_method());\n```\n\nFor a `GDScriptNativeClass` object, `has_method()` returns `false` for this native static method.\n\nHowever, `Callable::callp()` does not rely on `is_valid()`. Instead, it uses `ClassDB::get_method(\"FileAccess\", \"file_exists\")` to find the method and execute it. This is why the original Callable can still be called successfully.\n\nAfter binding arguments, the Callable changes to a custom Callable, so `bound.is_custom() == true`.\n\nAt this point, `Callable::callp()` checks `is_valid()` for the custom Callable and reports an error. As a result, the Callable with bound arguments can no longer be called.\n\nMy conclusion is that the result of `Callable.is_valid()` is not reliable. It does not accurately reflect whether a Callable can actually be called. Furthermore, this unreliable result causes a Callable that has arguments bound with `bind()` to become uncallable.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5871562675/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5871661557","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123848#issuecomment-5871661557","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123848","id":5871661557,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXfpx9Q","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-28T14:10:57Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T14:10:57Z","body":"Please update the issue description to be less verbose and more clear, thank you ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5871661557/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5872597946","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123848#issuecomment-5872597946","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123848","id":5872597946,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXgi7ug","user":{"login":"Zireael07","id":4525388,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjUzODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4525388?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07","html_url":"https://github.com/Zireael07","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.git